# Mapping for scripts/sync-references.sh
#
# Format: <tab>-separated, 3 columns:
#   1. destination path under skills/<skill>/references/
#   2. source path under docs-pages clone (relative to repo root)
#   3. note (optional, # comment if you want to skip a line)
#
# Lines starting with `#` are comments. Empty lines are ignored.
#
# To add a new file: append a line, then re-run the script.
# To override a file: set dest path to a file the script won't touch and
#   commit it manually (the script warns if it would overwrite an existing
#   file unless --force is passed).
#
# Last verified against docs-pages @ master (commit 3b8669b, 2026-08-16).

# --- euv ---
skills/euv/references/animation.md		src/euv/usage-introduction/animation.md
